# This project's agent instructions are tracked deliberately.
# The machine-global gitignore excludes **/*claude*; re-include just the root file.
# (A repo .gitignore takes precedence over core.excludesFile.)
!/CLAUDE.md

# Prisma's generated client is derived from schema.prisma and rebuilt by the
# `postinstall` script. prisma.config.ts falls back to a placeholder URL so
# `prisma generate` works on a fresh clone before any .env exists.
apps/backend/src/generated/
